WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.060
Alex runs right up close to grab the kite.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:11.493
You can have it back. But first, come for a walk with me!

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:22.003
Uh-oh! The grown-up holds the kite up high, and Alex is too close. Dad is far away and can't help.
